# 🚴 Bike Sales Data Analysis (Excel Project)

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing bike sales data using Excel, transforming raw data into a clean and structured dataset, and building a simple interactive dashboard.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Clean and organize raw sales data  
- Analyze customer demographics  
- Identify purchasing patterns  
- Build a dashboard to visualize key metrics  

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Excel  
- Pivot Tables  
- Data Cleaning Techniques  

---

## 🔄 Process

1. Data Cleaning (removing duplicates, fixing formats)  
2. Data Transformation (creating new columns and metrics)  
3. Analysis using Pivot Tables  
4. Dashboard creation  

---

## 📊 Key Insights

- Certain age groups are more likely to purchase bikes  
- Income level influences purchasing decisions  
- Customer demographics impact sales trends  

